WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.880
- Before we go, I have one
more uplifting story to share.

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:04.360
This is What I'm Liking.

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:07.510
(upbeat bright music)

00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:09.620
TikTok has turned lots of regular people

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:11.030
into bonafide stars.

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:14.700
And one of the most unexpected
is 79 year old Kenny Jary.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:16.140
Kenny is a Navy vet

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:18.780
who served during the
Cuban missile crisis.

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:21.280
Kenny has such a big
personality and kind heart.

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:23.570
His neighbor Amanda started the channel,

00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:26.490
documenting his everyday life.

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:31.240
Now he's known to his 1.3
million fans as Patriotic Kenny.

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:32.370
So it's no surprise

00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:34.700
when Kenny's mobility scooter broke down.

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:37.600
The Tiktok community was quick to help.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:39.696
- Oh my goodness.

00:00:39.696 --> 00:00:43.266
(car engine roaring)

00:00:43.266 --> 00:00:44.732
Oh my goodness.

00:00:44.732 --> 00:00:47.082
(car engine roaring )

00:00:47.082 --> 00:00:48.915
Oh my goodness Amanda.

00:00:50.246 --> 00:00:53.079
(old man crying)

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:56.000
- You honking your horn.

00:00:57.277 --> 00:00:59.120
(old man crying)

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:01.630
- I can't believe that.

00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:02.663
Is this right?

00:01:02.663 --> 00:01:04.869
- This is all yours.

00:01:04.869 --> 00:01:07.698
(audience clapping)

00:01:07.698 --> 00:01:09.033
- And that's not all

00:01:09.033 --> 00:01:12.260
Kenny's fans raise so much money

00:01:12.260 --> 00:01:15.070
over $100,000 in counting actually,

00:01:15.070 --> 00:01:17.150
that they're donating dozens of scooters

00:01:17.150 --> 00:01:18.780
to other veterans.

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:21.987
Let's get Kenny and his
neighbor Amanda in here.

00:01:21.987 --> 00:01:23.099
What's up you all!

00:01:23.099 --> 00:01:24.788
(audience cheering)

00:01:24.788 --> 00:01:25.737
hello!

00:01:25.737 --> 00:01:28.763
(audience cheering)

00:01:28.763 --> 00:01:31.810
well, hello to both of you.

00:01:31.810 --> 00:01:33.060
kenny You're looking sharp enough.

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:35.008
So thank you so much for your service.

00:01:35.008 --> 00:01:37.153
(audience clapping)

00:01:37.153 --> 00:01:38.410
- Thank you.

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:39.300
- Well, Amanda,

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:40.660
can you tell us more about

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:42.570
why you started the Tiktok channel?

00:01:42.570 --> 00:01:44.430
- Sure. I would love to,

00:01:44.430 --> 00:01:45.560
well, you know, Kenny,

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:47.900
he started learning sign language in part,

00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:48.800
after we met,

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:50.490
I teach at a deaf school

00:01:50.490 --> 00:01:52.460
and my friends and family, Jenny,

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:54.010
his buddy, Jerry are all deaf.

00:01:54.010 --> 00:01:55.730
And so he was learning ASL

00:01:55.730 --> 00:01:56.940
and I started posting videos

00:01:56.940 --> 00:01:58.290
about that journey.

00:01:58.290 --> 00:02:00.240
Then the scooter broke down

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:01.410
and I posted a video

00:02:01.410 --> 00:02:02.850
and really I just knew that

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:05.000
people in our community loved Kenny

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:06.849
and the world would love
Kenny and I was right.

00:02:06.849 --> 00:02:09.472
I just didn't expect it to be that right.

00:02:09.472 --> 00:02:10.950
(chuckling)

00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:12.970
- You're a hit Kenny.

00:02:12.970 --> 00:02:16.640
Well, Kenny, Amanda is
like family to you, right?

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:17.527
- Yes she is.

00:02:18.593 --> 00:02:22.070
Yes, we do all kinds of nice fun place.

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:22.903
She sure is.

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:24.843
- I love that.

00:02:25.792 --> 00:02:27.390
Well, Kenny

00:02:27.390 --> 00:02:28.680
what does it mean that

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:30.550
so many people stepped up to help you?

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:32.000
It seemed like it really affected you.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:32.833
It was so beautiful

00:02:32.833 --> 00:02:35.210
when you found out that scooter was yours.

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:36.593
- Yes, it did.

00:02:37.520 --> 00:02:38.353
- What they mean to you?

00:02:38.353 --> 00:02:40.558
- What did that mean to me?

00:02:40.558 --> 00:02:42.260
That meant the world to me,

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:45.333
you know, it's just so awesome.

00:02:46.340 --> 00:02:48.000
When that scooter that I got,

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:50.230
I never thought that
would happen to my life.

00:02:50.230 --> 00:02:51.320
Believe me.

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:52.270
- Oh my God. Well,

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:54.130
I couldn't think of a
better person to give it to

00:02:54.130 --> 00:02:55.660
you are such a sweetheart

00:02:55.660 --> 00:02:58.040
and you're so fun and you're such a light.

00:02:58.040 --> 00:02:59.240
Thank you so much Amanda

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:00.900
for sharing these videos.

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:02.880
And thank you Kenny, for joining us.

00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:05.104
I'm liking a post right now, right?

00:03:05.104 --> 00:03:07.760
(audience clapping)

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:08.800
And that's not all

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:10.450
our season long partner pilot pin.

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:12.070
The go to pin of the Kelly Clarkson show

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:14.470
wants to honor ultimate overachievers

00:03:14.470 --> 00:03:15.690
just like you.

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:16.830
So they're going to be using

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:18.560
their G2 jelling pen to write.

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:20.210
you a cheque for a $1000.

00:03:20.210 --> 00:03:21.688
That's $500 each.

00:03:21.688 --> 00:03:24.136
(audience cheering)

00:03:24.136 --> 00:03:26.043
- Oh my goodness.

00:03:26.043 --> 00:03:29.001
(audience clapping)

00:03:29.001 --> 00:03:29.834
- [Show Host] All right

00:03:29.834 --> 00:03:31.481
Thank you guys, God glows!

